  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 29d1fddd189524fb8adc5a32ce42aab2, type: 3}
  m_Name: SO_MariaDiary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EvidenceData
  evidenceId: diary
  displayName: A kids diary
  interactionDisplayName: Diary
  evidenceImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0a687c91f1a914cfaaa3db4664737c82, type: 3}
  pages:
  - heading: May 13
    body: "Dear Diary\nHehehe, he\u2019ll never bother me with that stupid train
      ever again! I hid it somewhere where he\u2019ll never find it! Mom's just been
      ordering food anyway, so she won't find it. I'm a freaking genius!!"
  - heading: May 14
    body: "Dear Diary\nIt\u2019s finally here! My birthday!! I\u2019ve been waiting
      for so long! I\u2019m finally gonna get all my presents, and Dad promised he\u2019d
      take us out for dinner, and let me pick! I think we\u2019re gonna get pizza,
      but I\u2019m not sure. Tomorrow is gonna be so great!!"
  - heading: May 15
    body: "Dear Diary\nToday was so AWFUL!!! Dad lied to me again, and Mom didn\u2019t
      even make me dinner! None of my friends showed up, and it\u2019s all their
      fault! Why do we have to live in the woods?! I hate this stupid house, and
      this stupid family!"
  - heading: May 17
    body: "Dear Diary\nUncle Franc has been coming over more, and it sucks! He\u2019s
      nothing like Uncle Al! Uncle Al likes to play with us, and he always brings
      gifts! Uncle Franc just sits around and talks to Mom all day. If we try to
      talk he shouts at us. Mom doesn\u2019t even do anything! She just sits there
      all quiet like she can\u2019t help. I hate him!"
  - heading: May 18
    body: "Dear Diary\nToday I saw Mom playing with the safe. I don\u2019t know what
      she\u2019s doing anymore. She just sits around all day now. I haven\u2019t
      even seen her agenda anywhere. She\u2019s usually carrying it all around the
      house. Something\u2019s going on, and no one will tell me anything!"
  - heading: May 19
    body: "Deer Diary\nI hate this! Julian won\u2019t stop crying for Mom! It\u2019s
      annoying! I\u2019ve got homework, and I can\u2019t focus! Why does everyone
      in this family hate me?"
  - heading: May 20
    body: "Dear Diary\nI don\u2019t know what\u2019s happening. Uncle Franc is back
      and he\u2019s off with Mom again. But they\u2019re in the bedroom, and locked
      the door. Julian\u2019s been crying more than usual. I guess they kicked him
      out? I tried talking to her again, but no one\u2019s answering. I know they\u2019re
      in there. I can hear something through the wall."
  description: A small diary. Belongs to Maria Rivera. There's lots of stories, doodles
    and such
  detectiveLine: I should keep this in mind...
  detectiveAudio: {fileID: 0}
  thoughtOnly: 0
